    {"text": "Ek Indian startup ka profit ek saal mein 3.3 guna ho gaya, aur Inc42 ke mutabik uski kamaai ka 99.9% sirf subscription se aata hai.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/aae3283c-0eb3-5edd-9790-f993781123ae/scratchpad/w/l1.wav"},
    {"text": "Pehli baat: ek baar bechke bhool gaye, toh har mahine zero se shuru karna padta hai. Repeat income se aapko pehle se pata hota hai ki agle mahine kitna aayega.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/aae3283c-0eb3-5edd-9790-f993781123ae/scratchpad/w/l2.wav"},
    {"text": "Doosri baat: repeat income har business mein ban sakti hai. Membership, refill ya monthly retainer. Customer ko har mahine kuch chhota sa dena shuru karo.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/aae3283c-0eb3-5edd-9790-f993781123ae/scratchpad/w/l3.wav"},
    {"text": "Teesri baat: renewal ka reminder aur payment automatic rakho, taaki aapko yaad na rakhna pade. Hustle nahi, system banao. Ye reel save kar lo.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/aae3283c-0eb3-5edd-9790-f993781123ae/scratchpad/w/l4.wav"}
